  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "87E3670EF89B19FA",
      "text": "Bonjour, les enfants ! J’espère qu’il vous tarde\\nd’en apprendre plus sur la biologie ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "87E3660EF89B1847",
      "text": "Je dois dire que j’ai été très impressionné par\\nvos résultats au contrôle partiel ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "87E3650EF89B1694",
      "text": "Je tenais aussi à vous remercier, car vos réponses\\nau sondage m’ont bien aidé !\\c\\nJe suis sûr qu’elles me seront très utiles pour\\nmes prochains travaux ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "87E3640EF89B14E1",
      "text": "Bien, nous allons maintenant attaquer la seconde\\nmoitié du programme.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "87E3630EF89B132E",
      "text": "Il est temps de faire évoluer nos connaissances,\\nà l’instar des Pokémon ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "87E3620EF89B117B",
      "text": "Et vous vous doutez sûrement que si je vous\\ndis ça...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "87E3610EF89B0FC8",
      "text": "... c’est parce que le cours d’aujourd’hui porte\\nsur l’évolution des Pokémon ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "87E3600EF89B0E15",
      "text": "En combattant, les Pokémon gagnent des niveaux,\\nce qui leur permet d’apprendre de nouvelles\\r\\ncapacités et de devenir plus puissants.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "87E35F0EF89B0C62",
      "text": "Et lorsqu’ils atteignent un certain niveau...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "87DFE20EF8980224",
      "text": "Leur apparence change et leurs stats augmentent\\nde manière significative.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "87DFE30EF89803D7",
      "text": "Ce phénomène s’appelle donc l’évolution ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "87DFE40EF898058A",
      "text": "Il renforce les Pokémon, qui deviennent alors\\nde précieux partenaires en combat.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "87DFE50EF898073D",
      "text": "Toutefois, certaines personnes préfèrent ne pas\\nfaire évoluer leurs Pokémon, car elles\\r\\nles trouvent plus mignons ainsi.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "87DFDE0EF897FB58",
      "text": "En effet, vous pouvez empêcher un Pokémon\\nd’évoluer. Il suffit pour cela d’appuyer sur un\\r\\nbouton, au moment de l’évolution.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "87DFDF0EF897FD0B",
      "text": "Et si nous le disions en chœur ? Pour empêcher\\nun Pokémon d’évoluer, il faut appuyer sur...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_a_05_select_01",
      "hash64": "B9D7A97DF6F13C16",
      "text": "Le bouton A !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_a_05_select_02",
      "hash64": "B9D7A87DF6F13A63",
      "text": "Le bouton B !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_a_05_select_03",
      "hash64": "B9D7A77DF6F138B0",
      "text": "Le bouton C !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_answer_01",
      "hash64": "59FAA449A854AA93",
      "text": "... Il me semble que tout le monde a bien\\nrépondu, à l’exception [VAR 0x1408(0000,0001)][VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\c\\nPour rappel, le bouton A sert plutôt à valider ou\\nà approuver.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1408",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000",
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_answer_02",
      "hash64": "59FAA549A854AC46",
      "text": "Tout à fait ! On ne peut rien vous cacher ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_answer_03",
      "hash64": "59FAA649A854ADF9",
      "text": "... Il me semble que tout le monde a bien\\nrépondu, à l’exception [VAR 0x1408(0000,0001)][VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\c\\nVoilà bien longtemps que je n’avais pas entendu\\nparler du bouton C ! Ça me rend nostalgique.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1408",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000",
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 171,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_16",
      "hash64": "87DFE00EF897FEBE",
      "text": "Comme je le disais, vous pouvez empêcher\\nl’évolution d’un Pokémon avec le bouton B ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_17",
      "hash64": "87DFE10EF8980071",
      "text": "Il suffit d’appuyer dessus dès que le processus\\nd’évolution commence. L’apparence du Pokémon\\r\\nrestera identique.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_18",
      "hash64": "87DFDA0EF897F48C",
      "text": "Sachez également que faire tenir une Pierre Stase\\nà un Pokémon l’empêchera aussi d’évoluer.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_19",
      "hash64": "87DFDB0EF897F63F",
      "text": "Cela étant, gardez en tête que les conditions\\nd’évolution varient d’un Pokémon à l’autre.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_20",
      "hash64": "87EA540EF8A1185F",
      "text": "Certains ont besoin d’objets tels qu’une\\nPierre Feu ou une Pierre Foudre pour évoluer.\\c\\nD’autres doivent apprendre certaines capacités\\nou vaincre certains Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 165,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_21",
      "hash64": "87EA530EF8A116AC",
      "text": "Par exemple, Colossinge évolue en Courrousinge\\ndans des conditions plutôt insolites ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_22",
      "hash64": "87EA560EF8A11BC5",
      "text": "En effet, il existe une capacité qui...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_23",
      "hash64": "87EA550EF8A11A12",
      "text": "Oups ! C’est déjà l’heure...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_24",
      "hash64": "87EA500EF8A11193",
      "text": "C’est tout pour aujourd’hui. Je compte sur vous\\npour bien réviser avant notre prochaine leçon.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
